    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "insights_list",
      "x": 520, "y": 1355,
      "width": 360, "height": 210,
      "text": "1. Trunk is the hardest class\n   126 trunk → ambient (most confused)\n   133 trunk → twig\n   38  trunk → leaf\n   Only 164/461 correctly classified\n\n2. Leaf ↔ Twig mutual confusion\n   leaf → twig: 14 cases\n   twig → leaf: 106 cases\n   Both are high-frequency movement\n\n3. Ambient is near-perfect\n   Precision/Recall ~1.0\n   Clear audio signature vs. contact\n\n4. ~0.72 ceiling with current approach\n   Domain shift hand→robot is severe\n   Needs better features or robot-like val set",
      "originalText": "1. Trunk is the hardest class\n   126 trunk → ambient (most confused)\n   133 trunk → twig\n   38  trunk → leaf\n   Only 164/461 correctly classified\n\n2. Leaf ↔ Twig mutual confusion\n   leaf → twig: 14 cases\n   twig → leaf: 106 cases\n   Both are high-frequency movement\n\n3. Ambient is near-perfect\n   Precision/Recall ~1.0\n   Clear audio signature vs. contact\n\n4. ~0.72 ceiling with current approach\n   Domain shift hand→robot is severe\n   Needs better features or robot-like val set",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
