      "x": 50, "y": 1620,
      "width": 850, "height": 40,
      "text": "Design principle: Strict no-test-until-lock — all selections via OOF on hand/default. Features: 240D handcrafted audio (MFCC + STFT + Mel + FFT).\nNo deep learning, no label leakage, no image features. Segment/specimen group-consistency inference enforces coherence.",
      "originalText": "Design principle: Strict no-test-until-lock — all selections via OOF on hand/default. Features: 240D handcrafted audio (MFCC + STFT + Mel + FFT).\nNo deep learning, no label leakage, no image features. Segment/specimen group-consistency inference enforces coherence.",
